{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1041341542702074, "source": "求", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.8921931802950946, "source": "事", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.209494669928034, "source": "事", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.046343860122353, "source": "事", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.2286654169163074, "source": "事", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 3.0204248861443626, "source": "智", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 3.0204248861443626, "source": "智", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.279958711303858, "source": "仁", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 0.7691330875378674, "source": "仁", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.4326608509166544, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.7691330875378674, "source": "仁", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.9218125974762528, "source": "誠", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.1449561487904627, "source": "誠", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 3.0204248861443626, "source": "反", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 1.2286654169163074, "source": "反", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 3.0204248861443626, "source": "從", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.6839526495231496, "source": "從", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.8232003088081431, "source": "親", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.0055218656020977, "source": "親", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.9908054689632042, "source